    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You fling a disorienting force at one creature within range. The target makes a Constitution saving throw; Constructs and Undead succeed automatically.</p><p>On a failure, the target takes 2d4 Force damage, its Speed is halved until the start of your next turn, and on its next turn it can take either an action or a Bonus Action, not both. On a success, it only takes half as much damage.</p><p><strong>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</strong> The damage increases by 2d4 for each spell slot level above 1.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-cCypjw79VzAs6yMU\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Constructs and Undead succeed automatically. The limit of an action or a Bonus Action is applied by hand.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
